tion><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-a-texas-womans-home-was-auctioned-for-20000-to-pay-an-unrelated-judgment-after-years-of-litigation-an-october-21-appeals-ruling-let-her-continue-arguing-it-had-homestead-protection/articleshow/135114391.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-a-texas-womans-home-was-auctioned-for-20000-to-pay-an-unrelated-judgment-after-years-of-litigation-an-october-21-appeals-ruling-let-her-continue-arguing-it-had-homestead-protection/articleshow/135114391.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T19:53:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135115087,imgsize-109038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[He left banking to revive a closed US wool mill; 12 years later, it supplies the military]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135115933.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Connecticut wool mill that closed in 2013, leaving 85 workers jobless, has been revived by former investment banker Jacob Harrison Long. He bought the 475,000-square-foot factory in 2014 despite having no manufacturing experience. Twelve years later, the mill employs about 50 people and supplies fabric for US military uniforms. Long now hopes to expand textile manufacturing across New England.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-a-former-banker-bought-a-475000-square-foot-connecticut-wool-mill-that-had-lost-85-jobs-12-years-later-jacob-longs-revived-factory-employs-about-50-people-and-makes-fabric-for-the-us-military/articleshow/135115933.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-a-former-banker-bought-a-475000-square-foot-connecticut-wool-mill-that-had-lost-85-jobs-12-years-later-jacob-longs-revived-factory-employs-about-50-people-and-makes-fabric-for-the-us-military/articleshow/135115933.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T18:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116725,imgsize-50292.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US accuses Canada of interference in midterm elections, Carney denies charges]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135119375.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-accuses-canada-of-interference-in-midterm-elections-carney-denies-charges/articleshow/135119375.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-accuses-canada-of-interference-in-midterm-elections-carney-denies-charges/articleshow/135119375.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T18:15:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135119569,imgsize-56432.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Even sick leave needs approval here: Indian techie shares three months' experience of moving from US to India on the same job, same company]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135119117.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/even-sick-leave-needs-approval-here-indian-techie-shares-three-months-experience-of-moving-from-us-to-india-on-the-same-job-same-company/articleshow/135119117.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/even-sick-leave-needs-approval-here-indian-techie-shares-three-months-experience-of-moving-from-us-to-india-on-the-same-job-same-company/articleshow/135119117.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T18:00:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135119191,imgsize-90860.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mike Tyson earned $400 million, went bankrupt; now his perfumes are worth $50,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135118711.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mike-tyson-earned-an-estimated-400-million-in-boxing-filed-for-bankruptcy-in-2003-at-60-his-perfume-collection-is-worth-50000/articleshow/135118711.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mike-tyson-earned-an-estimated-400-million-in-boxing-filed-for-bankruptcy-in-2003-at-60-his-perfume-collection-is-worth-50000/articleshow/135118711.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T17:53:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135118975,imgsize-76922.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[France unrest: Macron vows ban on 'illegitimate' protests in coming days]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135117417.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In response to escalating unrest, French President Emmanuel Macron unveiled plans to prohibit unauthorized protests while ramping up security measures. Following extensive riots and vandalism, authorities brace for further gatherings this weekend. Trade unions and recognized groups will be directed to alternative protest paths to mitigate potential damage, with the initial disturbances rooted in student protests spurring broader demonstrations against rising living costs, just ahead of France's upcoming presidential election.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-unrest-macron-vows-ban-on-illegitimate-protests-in-coming-days-blames-seditious-ultra-left/articleshow/135117417.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-unrest-macron-vows-ban-on-illegitimate-protests-in-coming-days-blames-seditious-ultra-left/articleshow/135117417.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:56:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135117587,imgsize-92752.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Barbara Corcoran's $16M NYC penthouse becomes a beach house on Fifth Avenue]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116891.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/shark-tanks-barbara-corcoran-saw-a-new-york-penthouse-seven-months-before-it-was-listed-and-outbid-herself-twice-after-a-nine-month-makeover-the-3100-square-foot-home-has-become-her-beach-house-on-fifth-avenue/articleshow/135116891.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/shark-tanks-barbara-corcoran-saw-a-new-york-penthouse-seven-months-before-it-was-listed-and-outbid-herself-twice-after-a-nine-month-makeover-the-3100-square-foot-home-has-become-her-beach-house-on-fifth-avenue/articleshow/135116891.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T17:11:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116974,imgsize-701867.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan neighbours accuse each other of flooding their land; both awarded damages]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135113248.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A years-long dispute between neighbours in Michigan over flooding and water flowing across their properties resulted in both sides receiving compensation. A jury awarded $85,000 to William Michael Coan and Cindy Plant and $91,250 to Robert Ercolani. On October 20, 2026, the Michigan Court of Appeals upheld both awards and an independent drainage plan intended to address the flooding.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-michigan-neighbours-spent-years-fighting-over-water-flowing-across-their-land-a-jury-awarded-85000-in-damages-to-one-side-and-91250-to-the-other-and-an-appeals-court-upheld-both-awards/articleshow/135113248.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-michigan-neighbours-spent-years-fighting-over-water-flowing-across-their-land-a-jury-awarded-85000-in-damages-to-one-side-and-91250-to-the-other-and-an-appeals-court-upheld-both-awards/articleshow/135113248.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T17:10:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135113963,imgsize-253760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[London duplex once home to Keira Knightley lists for £11.5M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116758.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After an extensive two-year renovation, the Hyde Park Gardens duplex in London stands elegantly restored. Spanning 4,071 square feet, the lavish residence boasts three bedrooms and bathrooms, complemented by a private terrace overlooking four acres of communal greens. Available for £11.5 million, it’s perfect for those craving luxury and convenience, with nearby attractions including Connaught Village and accessible transport at Lancaster Gate and Paddington stations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-london-terrace-once-home-to-keira-knightley-and-lord-randolph-churchill-has-been-restored-over-two-years-the-4071-square-foot-three-bedroom-duplex-is-asking-11-5-million/articleshow/135116758.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-london-terrace-once-home-to-keira-knightley-and-lord-randolph-churchill-has-been-restored-over-two-years-the-4071-square-foot-three-bedroom-duplex-is-asking-11-5-million/articleshow/135116758.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:51:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135117123,imgsize-114760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US restaurant that offered free meals in protest against ICE to shut down permanently]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135117753.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-restaurant-that-offered-free-meals-in-protest-against-ice-to-shut-down-permanently/articleshow/135117753.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-restaurant-that-offered-free-meals-in-protest-against-ice-to-shut-down-permanently/articleshow/135117753.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T17:12:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135117919,imgsize-97511.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Yorkshire couple's straw-bale home, built in 2018, now listed for £2.75 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116318.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-yorkshire-couple-built-a-four-bedroom-home-using-straw-bales-and-lime-plaster-completed-in-2018-the-energy-conscious-property-is-now-listed-for-2-75-million/articleshow/135116318.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-yorkshire-couple-built-a-four-bedroom-home-using-straw-bales-and-lime-plaster-completed-in-2018-the-energy-conscious-property-is-now-listed-for-2-75-million/articleshow/135116318.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:29:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116861,imgsize-1257561.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Entrepreneur Rebuilds Beauty Brand: Nurse turns $500 into $100m; now backs Watch &amp; Sea]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135106645.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Courtney Adeleye made a remarkable shift from nursing to entrepreneurship by founding The Mane Choice, a haircare brand that achieved impressive success. Initially starting with a few products, the overwhelming demand prompted the addition of supplements, accelerating the brand's growth. Ultimately, The Mane Choice surpassed $100 million in annual sales, culminating in its acquisition for $61.5 million in 2019.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2013-former-nurse-courtney-adeleye-launched-the-mane-choice-from-her-kitchen-with-500-within-six-years-it-had-reached-100-million-in-sales-and-60000-retail-doors-before-a-reported-61-5-million-acquisition/articleshow/135106645.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2013-former-nurse-courtney-adeleye-launched-the-mane-choice-from-her-kitchen-with-500-within-six-years-it-had-reached-100-million-in-sales-and-60000-retail-doors-before-a-reported-61-5-million-acquisition/articleshow/135106645.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:26:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135106707,imgsize-116644.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin man, 24, killed in Canada highway crash days after permanent residency approval]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116587.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-man-24-killed-in-canada-highway-crash-days-after-permanent-residency-approval/articleshow/135116587.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-man-24-killed-in-canada-highway-crash-days-after-permanent-residency-approval/articleshow/135116587.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:21:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116656,imgsize-1455880.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Stand against hate’: Mamdani celebrates Navratri with Hindu New Yorkers after Illinois temple shooting plot]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135115594.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stand-against-hate-mamdani-celebrates-navratri-with-hindu-new-yorkers-after-illinois-temple-shooting-plot/articleshow/135115594.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stand-against-hate-mamdani-celebrates-navratri-with-hindu-new-yorkers-after-illinois-temple-shooting-plot/articleshow/135115594.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T15:58:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135115602,imgsize-162173.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1926, Frankfurt installed 10,000 modern fitted kitchens; today, volunteers are rescuing them]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135112190.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In the year 1926, Margarete Schütte-Lihotzky revolutionized domestic design by creating the Frankfurt Kitchen, aimed at maximizing cooking efficiency for urban dwellers. While around 10,000 of these iconic kitchens were initially integrated into Frankfurt residences, many have since succumbed to renovations. Today, preservationists are dedicated to conserving the remaining kitchens, adapting them with modern appliances while respecting their historical integrity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1926-frankfurt-began-installing-the-worlds-first-modern-fitted-kitchens-in-thousands-of-homes-a-century-later-most-are-gone-but-volunteers-have-saved-parts-from-about-50-as-a-new-preservation-effort-takes-shape/articleshow/135112190.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1926-frankfurt-began-installing-the-worlds-first-modern-fitted-kitchens-in-thousands-of-homes-a-century-later-most-are-gone-but-volunteers-have-saved-parts-from-about-50-as-a-new-preservation-effort-takes-shape/articleshow/135112190.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:18:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135112385,imgsize-556820.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oregon woman’s breast cancer diagnosis inspires husband’s gaming community to raise $1 million for research]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135112410.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[When Jessica Conwell confronted the daunting challenge of triple-negative breast cancer, her husband Matt leaned on his gaming community for support. This passionate group rallied together, spearheading fundraising activities that amassed a remarkable $55,000 in their inaugural event. Inspired by early success, they continued their efforts, ultimately raising over $1 million for critical cancer research.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/oregon-woman-was-diagnosed-with-triple-negative-breast-cancer-and-then-her-husbands-300-member-gaming-community-raised-1-million-for-research/articleshow/135112410.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/oregon-woman-was-diagnosed-with-triple-negative-breast-cancer-and-then-her-husbands-300-member-gaming-community-raised-1-million-for-research/articleshow/135112410.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:18:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135112502,imgsize-938336.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Netanyahu denies report that Trump blocked planned Israeli strike on October 10]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116019.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel has refuted allegations that President Donald Trump interrupted a military mission planned against Iran. A Financial Times article suggested that Israel had intentions for airstrikes on Iran’s nuclear facilities, which were ultimately dropped due to Trump's disapproval, influenced by worries regarding economic fallout before the midterm elections, particularly concerning fuel prices.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/netanyahu-denies-report-that-trump-blocked-planned-israeli-strike-on-october-10/articleshow/135116019.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/netanyahu-denies-report-that-trump-blocked-planned-israeli-strike-on-october-10/articleshow/135116019.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:04:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116235,imgsize-143206.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Minnesota couple’s $27,000 neighbour dispute ends with $20,000 privacy award reversed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135112821.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In Minnesota, a conflict brewed between two couples over a shared driveway and the removal of a tree. The Stahleys performed maintenance on the Rubys' land without consent, leading to a legal battle. Ultimately, the court awarded the Rubys $27,000, with $20,000 for invasion of privacy. However, the appeals court overturned the privacy ruling, necessitating further proceedings and adjusting the damages for tree removal.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-a-minnesota-couple-bought-a-home-reached-through-a-neighbours-gravel-driveway-a-feud-over-trees-and-a-security-camera-led-to-27000-in-damages-but-an-appeals-court-reversed-the-20000-privacy-award/articleshow/135112821.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-a-minnesota-couple-bought-a-home-reached-through-a-neighbours-gravel-driveway-a-feud-over-trees-and-a-security-camera-led-to-27000-in-damages-but-an-appeals-court-reversed-the-20000-privacy-award/articleshow/135112821.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:20:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135112986,imgsize-2353930.cms"/></item></channel></rss>